---
import Site from "../layouts/Site.astro";
---

<Site title="Privacy">
  <header class="page-head wrap">
    <h1>Privacy</h1>
  </header>
  <section class="section wrap">
    <div class="prose">
      <p>
        This is Quentin Nichols’ personal website. If you contact me by email, I use the information you share to
        respond to your message.
      </p>
      <h2>Analytics</h2>
      <p>
        This site uses Google Analytics to understand which pages people visit. Google’s privacy practices apply to
        that information.
      </p>
      <h2>Connected services</h2>
      <p>
        Public contact information is managed through N3XRA Contact Card. Photographs shown here are selected for public
        viewing. Private client galleries are separate.
      </p>
      <p>
        Video thumbnails load from YouTube. When you choose to play a video, an embedded YouTube player loads and
        YouTube’s privacy practices apply. You can also watch videos directly on YouTube.
      </p>
      <p>
        When subscription signup is available, N3XRA Communications manages the preferences you choose. Contacting me
        does not subscribe you to updates.
      </p>
      <h2>Questions</h2>
      <p>
        Email <a href="mailto:quentin@quentinnichols.com">quentin@quentinnichols.com</a> about this website or your
        information.
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Site>
